248:Huh?
249:Have I been too gentle to you today? Is that why you're making up such rumors about me?! I'm not an immature child like that!
250:Er... But your mother is always somewhere else. Don't you miss her?
251:...You're so annoying. I don't want to talk to an idiot.
252:Can you tell me? I want to know what you think.
253:...My mother is a great doctor. She works to improve the health of humans, and her patients need her, so I won't waste my mother's time like that.
