272:Chiori Mikami reacts very strongly to my suggestion. What should I do next...?
273:Respect Chiori Mikami's thoughts and play mahjong with her.
274:Fine, let's look for a mahjong dojo then.
275:Since she reacted so strongly, I choose to compromise.
277:There is only one tile remaining in the wall in front of me. The two Jyanshi on my left and right stare nervously at Chiori Mikami's outstretched hand.
